 Loss&#xa;Stop after Five Non-improving Epochs&#xa;Run Six Different Random Seeds" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1344" y="576" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="23" value="Are Gold Labels Available&#xa;for the Evaluated Split?" style="rhombus;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFF3E0;strokeColor=#FF9800;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1064" y="576" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="24" value="Public Test Labels Are Redacted&#xa;PhysioNet Documents gold_label Hidden&#xa;Released Reader Drops Label '-'&#xa;No Test Accuracy from Those Rows Alone" style="rounded=1;arcSize=50;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#ECEFF1;strokeColor=#607D8B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1064" y="896" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="25" value="Released Reproduction Code&#xa;read_nli_data Drops gold_label '-'&#xa;Legacy Python 3.4 / 3.6.3&#xa;PyTorch 0.2.0 + MetaMap / UMLS" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="784" y="576" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="26" value="Implementation Boundary&#xa;No Hosted Evaluator or Output Parser&#xa;No Invalid-output Policy&#xa;No Official Live Leaderboard" style="shape=document;boundedLbl=1;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=w